---
---

<section id="character-design" class="section-padding relative overflow-hidden bg-bg-base">
  <!-- Organic background shapes -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-5" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg class="absolute bottom-10 -left-24 w-[450px] h-[450px] text-neon-blue animate-float-reverse" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="currentColor">
      <path d="M47.7,-63.2C60.9,-54.6,70.1,-38.7,73.6,-22.1C77.1,-5.5,74.9,11.8,68,27.2C61.1,42.5,49.5,55.9,35,63.7C20.6,71.5,3.3,73.6,-14.7,70.8C-32.8,68,-51.7,60.2,-62.7,46.7Z" transform="translate(50,50)" />
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="section-container relative z-10">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-24 reveal">
      <span class="text-xs font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-neon-blue font-medium">Concepto & Vector</span>
      <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-2">Diseño de Personajes</h2>
      <div class="mt-6 h-0.5 w-16 bg-neon-blue"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Presentation Grid -->
    <div class="grid items-center gap-24 md:grid-cols-2">
      <!-- Preview Image Left -->
      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1 order-2 md:order-1">
        <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl neon-border shadow-lg">
          <div class="absolute -inset-0.5 rounded-2xl bg-neon-blue/20 opacity-0 blur-sm transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100"></div>
          <img
            src="/images/character.png"
            alt="Character Design illustrations by mrtx studio"
            class="relative w-full rounded-2xl object-cover aspect-[4/3] transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Info Right -->
      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2 order-1 md:order-2 flex flex-col gap-8">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-3xl font-semibold text-neon-blue">Ilustraciones con alma futurista</h3>
        <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed text-text-primary">
          Creamos personajes vectoriales con líneas definidas y un potente contraste cromático. Ideal para proyectos editoriales de cómics, branding moderno, videojuegos o campañas publicitarias innovadoras.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-text-muted text-lg">
          Cada personaje se concibe desde el boceto a lápiz hasta la digitalización final en vectores limpios y escalables. Cuidamos al detalle las expresiones, las paletas de color y los accesorios para dotar a cada figura de una historia propia.
        </p>

        <!-- Bullet Highlights -->
        <ul class="space-y-4 mt-4">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-4 text-base text-text-primary">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-neon-blue"></span>
            Arte conceptual y bocetado inicial.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-4 text-base text-text-primary">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-neon-blue"></span>
            Trazado vectorial impecable (SVG/AI).
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-4 text-base text-text-primary">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-neon-blue"></span>
            Ilustración promocional de alto impacto.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
